1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,909
Hello Mira, this is Ravi speaking.

2
00:00:02,909 --> 00:00:08,897
I'm calling to discuss the plan for
next week's community health camp.

3
00:00:08,897 --> 00:00:13,345
We met with the panchayat
members yesterday evening,

4
00:00:13,345 --> 00:00:20,189
and they have granted us permission to
use the hall next to the post office from

5
00:00:20,189 --> 00:00:21,900
Monday to Wednesday.

6
00:00:21,930 --> 00:00:25,220
The hall has electricity
and water facilities,

7
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:30,299
and there are two side rooms that we
can use for private consultations.

8
00:00:30,299 --> 00:00:36,379
Dr. Sharma will arrive at 9 am on Monday
morning; she will bring two nurses with her,

9
00:00:36,379 --> 00:00:42,030
and the district office is sending a van
with basic medicines and testing kits.

10
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:47,737
With an expected turnout of around
three hundred people over three days,

11
00:00:47,737 --> 00:00:54,282
we will need at least six volunteers per
day to manage registration and the waiting

12
00:00:54,282 --> 00:00:59,880
area. On the first day, we will focus
on children under five years old.

13
00:00:59,940 --> 00:01:06,340
Please ask the Anganwadi workers to bring
vaccination cards because many parents

14
00:01:06,340 --> 00:01:12,180
forget them. The second day's camp is
for pregnant women and the elderly,

15
00:01:12,180 --> 00:01:18,900
and blood pressure and sugar tests will be
conducted for all people over forty years

16
00:01:18,900 --> 00:01:22,260
of age. The third day is open to everyone,

17
00:01:22,260 --> 00:01:27,300
and an eye specialist from the
city hospital will also join us.

18
00:01:27,330 --> 00:01:32,255
People who need glasses can
get a prescription on the spot,

19
00:01:32,255 --> 00:01:36,513
and the glasses will be
delivered within two weeks.

20
00:01:36,513 --> 00:01:40,186
I've printed two hundred
registration forms,

21
00:01:40,186 --> 00:01:43,860
but I think we should
print another hundred.

22
00:01:43,860 --> 00:01:48,535
Can you check with the printing
shop near the bus stand?

23
00:01:48,535 --> 00:01:51,540
They gave us a good price last time.

24
00:01:51,630 --> 00:01:55,880
We also need drinking water
for people waiting outside.

25
00:01:55,880 --> 00:02:00,595
The school has offered to provide
us with their water cooler,

26
00:02:00,595 --> 00:02:05,463
but someone will have to bring
it on a tempo on Sunday evening.

27
00:02:05,463 --> 00:02:10,950
Another thing: please remind everyone
that the camp is completely free.

28
00:02:10,950 --> 00:02:17,287
Last year, some people stayed away because
they thought they would have to pay for

29
00:02:17,287 --> 00:02:18,060
medicines.

30
00:02:18,120 --> 00:02:24,165
We can announce this on Saturday at
the temple and in the weekly market.

31
00:02:24,165 --> 00:02:26,936
If you can create a small notice,

32
00:02:26,936 --> 00:02:32,142
I will also ask my nephew to
share it with the village groups.

33
00:02:32,142 --> 00:02:37,767
Finally, volunteers should reach
the hall by 8:30 AM every morning.

34
00:02:37,767 --> 00:02:44,820
We will provide tea and lunch for them. If
anyone cannot come on a particular day...

35
00:02:44,880 --> 00:02:51,485
So, he should let me know by Sunday so
that I can arrange for someone else in his

36
00:02:51,485 --> 00:02:57,274
place. That's all for now. When you
receive this message, call me back.

37
00:02:57,274 --> 00:02:59,965
Thank you, and see you on Sunday.
